        "\n",
        "Install the packages this notebook needs and import everything used throughout. A single seed\n",
        "is fixed across `random`, NumPy and PyTorch so sampling and shuffling are reproducible.\n",
        "\n",
        "> `# ── PROVIDED ──` This cell is written for you. Run it and move on."
      ],
      "id": "-tATBUKK_-KJ"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
