    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "nH_OSaUI_-Kl"
      },
      "source": [
        "### <font color=\"blue\"><b>Step 5.1: Image Captioning</b></font>  <font color=\"red\">**[5 marks]**</font>\n"
      ],
      "id": "nH_OSaUI_-Kl"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "CWrzRZYD_-Km"
      },
      "source": [
        "Write a captioning **system prompt** that asks for a descriptive, visually-grounded\n",
        "caption (no hallucinated detail), then extend `vqa_generate`-style inference to accept a system\n",
        "prompt. Run it on **3 images** from `vqa_dataset`."
      ],
      "id": "CWrzRZYD_-Km"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "pEiDsWsS_-Km"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "#  Step 5.1: Captioning\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "captioning_system_prompt = \"\"\"\n",
        "## CODE HERE ##  (a captioning instruction: descriptive, visually-grounded, no hallucinated detail)\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "def generate_with_system(system_prompt, image, question=None, max_new_tokens=256):\n",
        "    content = [{\"type\": \"image\", \"image\": image}]\n",
        "    ## CODE HERE ##  (append a text content dict to `content` ONLY if `question` is given)\n",
        "\n",
        "    messages = [\n",
        "        {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": system_prompt},\n",
        "        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": content},\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "    ## CODE HERE ##  (same 5-step generate/decode pipeline as Step 4)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return output_text\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "for idx in [5, 40, 81]:\n",
        "    image = vqa_dataset[\"image\"][idx]\n",
        "    print(f\"[{idx}] Caption:\", generate_with_system(captioning_system_prompt, image))\n",
        "    print(\"-\" * 60)\n"
      ],
      "id": "pEiDsWsS_-Km"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2kb1zrJK_-Km"
      },
      "source": [
        "### <font color=\"blue\"><b>Step 5.2: Chain-of-Thought Counting</b></font>  <font color=\"red\">**[5 marks]**</font>\n"
      ],
      "id": "2kb1zrJK_-Km"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ahKKukp7_-Kn"
      },
      "source": [
        "Using `qty_dataset` (object-counting questions), write a **direct-answer** system\n",
        "prompt and a **chain-of-thought** system prompt that reasons region-by-region before giving a\n",
        "final count. Run both on the **same 2 images** and compare."
      ],
      "id": "ahKKukp7_-Kn"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "iyqV-FHZ_-Kn"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "#  Step 5.2: Chain-of-Thought Counting\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "direct_system_prompt = \"## CODE HERE ##\"  # answer with only the final number, no explanation\n",
        "\n",
        "cot_system_prompt = \"\"\"\n",
        "## CODE HERE ##\n",
        "# A counting assistant that reasons step by step:\n",
        "# breaks the image into regions, counts within each, sums them,\n",
        "# and states \"Hence, the final answer is N.\"\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "for idx in [17, 35]:\n",
        "    question = qty_dataset[\"question\"][idx]\n",
        "    image = qty_dataset[\"image\"][idx]\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(f\"[{idx}] Q: {question}\")\n",
        "    print(\"Direct:\", generate_with_system(direct_system_prompt, image, question))\n",
        "    print(\"CoT:\", generate_with_system(cot_system_prompt, image, question, max_new_tokens=400))\n",
        "    print(\"=\" * 60)\n"
      ],
      "id": "iyqV-FHZ_-Kn"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "EDoYdszQ_-Kn"
      },
      "source": [
