    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "D6xPHMZF_-K9"
      },
      "source": [
        "Using the **same 3 VQA samples from Step 4**, compare the base model's answers\n",
        "(already printed in Step 4) against the fine-tuned model's answers. Build a small\n",
        "`vqa_generate_ft` using the trained `trainer.model` (a `PeftModel`) and print the answers\n",
