        "## <font color=\"blue\"><b>Step 11: RRF Fusion and Grounded Generation</b></font>  <font color=\"red\">**[12 marks]**</font>\n"
      ],
      "id": "DAmn1Ffy_-LP"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "EUAV1eXT_-LP"
      },
      "source": [
        "### <font color=\"blue\"><b>Step 11.1: Reciprocal Rank Fusion</b></font>  <font color=\"red\">**[4 marks]**</font>\n"
      ],
      "id": "EUAV1eXT_-LP"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "J02U7I3T_-LR"
      },
      "source": [
        "Implement `rrf_retrieve` combining the FAISS and ColPali rankings with **Reciprocal\n",
        "Rank Fusion**: RRF(d) = Σ 1/(k + rank_r(d)), k=60. Compare FAISS-only, ColPali-only, and RRF\n",
        "top-3 for the same query."
      ],
      "id": "J02U7I3T_-LR"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "pnnG1XrS_-LR"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "#  Step 11.1: Reciprocal Rank Fusion\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "def rrf_retrieve(query, top_k=5, k=60):\n",
        "    n = len(RAG_DATASET)\n",
        "    text_results = text_retrieve(query, top_k=n)\n",
        "    colpali_results = colpali_retrieve(query, top_k=n)\n",
        "\n",
        "    ## CODE HERE ##\n",
        "    # 1. Build {idx: rank} dicts (rank starts at 1) for both result lists.\n",
        "    # 2. rrf_scores[idx] = 1/(k + text_rank.get(idx, n+1)) + 1/(k + colpali_rank.get(idx, n+1))\n",
        "    #    for every idx in range(n)\n",
        "    # 3. sort descending by rrf score, return top_k (idx, score) pairs\n",
        "    return fused[:top_k]\n",
        "\n",
        "test_query = \"a fluffy pet animal\"\n",
        "print(\"FAISS  :\", text_retrieve(test_query, top_k=3))\n",
        "print(\"ColPali:\", colpali_retrieve(test_query, top_k=3))\n",
        "print(\"RRF    :\", rrf_retrieve(test_query, top_k=3))\n"
      ],
      "id": "pnnG1XrS_-LR"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "LZU-BgUc_-LS"
      },
      "source": [
